# Rust build output.
/src-tauri/target/

# Schemas Tauri generates from the capability files at build time.
/src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# Built downloads. These belong on the Releases page, not in git history — a
# committed binary is another multi-megabyte blob in the repository forever,
# and deleting the file later does not remove it. See tools/publish-release.mjs.
/dist/

# Icons derived from assets/lunar-pad-icon.png by `cargo tauri icon`. They are
# regenerated on demand, but Windows needs icon.ico present to build at all, so
# the generated set is committed rather than ignored.

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
